1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,782
Writing, task two. E-mail number 17: Company party.

2
00:00:05,467 --> 00:00:14,770
You want to go to a company party with colleagues. Write an e-mail to a restaurant. Write an e-mail of at least thirty-five words. Write one sentence for each picture.

3
00:00:23,467 --> 00:00:24,533
Good afternoon,

4
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:29,193
we would like to hold a company party at your place because our company is celebrating ten years.

5
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:32,840
It will be on Friday 12 December from six in the evening.

6
00:00:33,133 --> 00:00:34,919
About twenty-five people will come.

7
00:00:35,233 --> 00:00:38,463
For food we want a cold buffet and hot meat with a side dish.

8
00:00:38,767 --> 00:00:41,435
We also need space for dancing and music.

9
00:00:41,733 --> 00:00:43,313
Thank you for your offer.

10
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:50,359
This e-mail has 53 words. One sentence for each picture. Don't forget the greeting at the beginning and the end.

11
00:00:51,067 --> 00:01:00,077
Write your own e-mail on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
